{"pin":"BH00030","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00030","anchor":"","first_line":"Sanctified praise, transcending reality and metaphor, beseemeth and befitteth the Most Exalted Lord, Who from the Point hath fashioned the four pillars [3.5s]... ...On the first day that the Ancient Beauty ascended His Most Great Throne in the garden named Ri?ván, the Tongue of Glory gave utterance to three blessed words.","first_line_orig":"حمد مقدس از حقیقت و مجاز حضرت بینیازیرا لایق و سزاست که از نقطه چهار رکن  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"7400","notes":" \u003ca href=\"https://d9263461.github.io/cl/Baha'i/Others/ROB/V1/Contents.html\"\u003eROB1.278\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#333\"\u003eLL#333\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"days","type_name":"Days of Remembrance","language":"it","lang_name":"Italian"},{"type":"days","type_name":"Days of Remembrance","language":"no","lang_name":"Norwegian"},{"type":"days","type_name":"Days of Remembrance","language":"en","lang_name":"English"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA44:205","source":"INBA44","locator":"205","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v044/?page=207"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AMB#09x","source":"AMB","locator":"09x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/fa/library/authoritative-texts/bahaullah/days-remembrance/4#443392513"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ASAT4.022x","source":"ASAT4","locator":"022x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/430.pdf#page=13"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK3.456.09x","source":"AVK3","locator":"456.09x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK3/ak3-460.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BCH.041x","source":"BCH","locator":"041x","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2021/02/bch.pdf#page=38"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS8.064x","source":"MAS8","locator":"064x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MAS8/mas8-64.html"},{"kind":"translation","c